  "contribution": {
    "summary": "Independently execute the existing Math C# portable dw.discovery draft-1 verifier under DWF against thirteen Decision-pinned envelope fixtures. Confirm two acceptances and eleven rejections with exact protocol/schema SHA identities and preserved four static candidate source pins. This is an evidence-only first step in owner-approved Discovery stage B; no new work package, agent skill, CLR binding, BrokerReady exposure or external AURA adoption is created.",
    "value": "RS131 upgrades the prior JavaScript-only portable preflight to genuinely executed Math C# evidence. A separate BCL checker verifies the thirteen pinned corpus decisions, two source SHA-256 digests, four candidate source Git blobs, previously accepted RS130 first-pass documentation, the completed 541-node plan and the draft-only M3-W03 product scope. DWF stages a scoped Discovery status and decision, runs the existing independent C# verifier, stores thirteen exact ordered case verdicts and records the SDK/RID. No public/broker, package or coordination claim is admitted.",
    "nextAction": "After RS131 succeeds, qualify a supported DWF work-package topology/rebaseline for the owner-approved M3-W03 Discovery C01/C02/C03 implementation. Workflow issue #139 remains open and installed Math SDK 0.1.59 lacks the documented full-subtree constructor; do not hand-edit the plan or hide product work inside completed M3 tasks. Stage D coordination only after properly qualified Discovery B.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "The four static AgentCallable candidates remain source-level selection proposals, not reflected method bindings, compiled invocation examples or a Math skill.",
      "Discovery broker adapters, serializable DTOs, generated manifest, permission model and AURA implementation are unqualified, regardless of portable corpus success.",
      "The approved M3-W03 work-package topology is not yet admitted by the installed Math DWF SDK; generic Workflow issue #139 tracks this gap.",
      "All eight accepted M0-M7 milestones and 541 native nodes remain done with no added completion achievements or synthetic M8.",
      "Unsent AURA/Decision/MCDM drafts, public NuGet publication, cross-version ABI and new scientific providers remain outside RS131."
    ],
    "achievements": []
  },
